    {
      "entry_id": "uniform-colour-srgb8-store",
      "subject": "Uniform colour stored on an sRGB8 channel (legacy colour management)",
      "status": "calibrated",
      "formula": "code = round(255 * encode(v)), with encode the IEC 61966-2-1 linear-to-sRGB function (12.92 v for v <= 0.0031308, else 1.055 v^(1/2.4) - 0.055) and v the colour component taken as linear; same codes for the sRGB, Working and Raw colour spaces (legacy colour management). Storage codes are recovered from the 16-bit export through the export calibration of the entry srgb8-export.",
      "public_sources": [
        {
          "source_id": "S-SRGB",
          "locator": "IEC 61966-2-1:1999 \u00a75.3 (encoding transfer function)"
        },
